  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The maximum angular speed of the hoop corresponds to the situation when the bead is just about to slide upwards.<br />The free-body diagram of the bead is<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"166\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image3-b1c22648-d561-4333-95d8-db75257ec90a.jpg\" style=\"max-width:\"100%\"; object-fit:contain\" width=\"394\" /><br /><br />For the bead not to slide upwards<br /><br /><math><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>r</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>N</mi></math> ...(i)<br /><br />Where <math><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>r</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math> ...(ii)<br /><br />From (i) and (ii) we get,<br /><br /><math><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msqrt></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
